  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This is an issue that only started happening with the big controls overhaul update.\n\nThe problem is different depending on which bindings you use, but the result is similar and nothing seems to solve it:\n\n1) Inability to grab Physbones when usinig the official bindings (it seems to attempt to grab and pose bones at the same time, causing them to be posed instantly and therefore preventing you from grabbing).\n\n2) Inability to pose Physbones when using legacy bindings. I've tried 10 different user-uploaded bindings and my old bindings. With those binding schemes, I am able to grab Physbones but am unable to pose them. I tried manually updating the old control scheme and remapping grip, but nothing seemed to work.",
